          "text": [
            "W: Skipping acquire of configured file 'main/source/Sources' as repository 'https://r2u.stat.illinois.edu/ubuntu noble InRelease' does not seem to provide it (sources.list entry misspelt?)\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "!apt-get -qq update\n",
        "!apt-get -qq install -y nmap\n",
        "!pip -q install pandas numpy scikit-learn matplotlib seaborn joblib streamlit reportlab requests datasets pyarrow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "7a7c25d1",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7a7c25d1"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 2. Load CIC-IDS2017 directly from Hugging Face\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook reads the `machine_learning` configuration of `bvsam/cic-ids-2017` directly through the Hugging Face Datasets library. No manual CSV download or upload is required.\n",
        "\n",
        "The repository contains approximately 2.83 million flow rows in this configuration. To keep Colab memory and training time manageable, the code streams the dataset and retains a capped, balanced sample of the project classes:\n",
        "- BENIGN\n",
        "- PortScan\n",
        "- DoS Hulk\n",
        "- DoS Slowloris\n",
        "\n",
        "DoS Hulk and DoS Slowloris are grouped into the project class `DoS`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/bvsam/cic-ids-2017\n",
        "\n",
        "The notebook uses only the flow-feature Parquet configuration, not the repository's raw PCAP collection."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 2,
      "id": "333ea12e",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "333ea12e",
        "outputId": "d7c566c9-d32f-4239-a5d0-4ec345a3db2a"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Loading CIC-IDS2017 from Hugging Face...\n",
            "This downloads/caches the dataset in the Colab runtime; no manual CSV upload is needed.\n",
            "Dataset loaded successfully.\n",
            "Number of rows: 2830743\n",
            "Columns: ['Destination Port', 'Flow Duration', 'Total Fwd Packets', 'Total Backward Packets', 'Total Length of Fwd Packets', 'Total Length of Bwd Packets', 'Fwd Packet Length Max', 'Fwd Packet Length Min', 'Fwd Packet Length Mean', 'Fwd Packet Length Std', 'Bwd Packet Length Max', 'Bwd Packet Length Min', 'Bwd Packet Length Mean', 'Bwd Packet Length Std', 'Flow Bytes/s', 'Flow Packets/s', 'Flow IAT Mean', 'Flow IAT Std', 'Flow IAT Max', 'Flow IAT Min', 'Fwd IAT Total', 'Fwd IAT Mean', 'Fwd IAT Std', 'Fwd IAT Max', 'Fwd IAT Min', 'Bwd IAT Total', 'Bwd IAT Mean', 'Bwd IAT Std', 'Bwd IAT Max', 'Bwd IAT Min', 'Fwd PSH Flags', 'Bwd PSH Flags', 'Fwd URG Flags', 'Bwd URG Flags', 'Fwd Header Length', 'Bwd Header Length', 'Fwd Packets/s', 'Bwd Packets/s', 'Min Packet Length', 'Max Packet Length', 'Packet Length Mean', 'Packet Length Std', 'Packet Length Variance', 'FIN Flag Count', 'SYN Flag Count', 'RST Flag Count', 'PSH Flag Count', 'ACK Flag Count', 'URG Flag Count', 'CWE Flag Count', 'ECE Flag Count', 'Down/Up Ratio', 'Average Packet Size', 'Avg Fwd Segment Size', 'Avg Bwd Segment Size', 'Fwd Header Length_duplicated_0', 'Fwd Avg Bytes/Bulk', 'Fwd Avg Packets/Bulk', 'Fwd Avg Bulk Rate', 'Bwd Avg Bytes/Bulk', 'Bwd Avg Packets/Bulk', 'Bwd Avg Bulk Rate', 'Subflow Fwd Packets', 'Subflow Fwd Bytes', 'Subflow Bwd Packets', 'Subflow Bwd Bytes', 'Init_Win_bytes_forward', 'Init_Win_bytes_backward', 'act_data_pkt_fwd', 'min_seg_size_forward', 'Active Mean', 'Active Std', 'Active Max', 'Active Min', 'Idle Mean', 'Idle Std', 'Idle Max', 'Idle Min', 'Label']\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "!pip -q install datasets pyarrow\n",
        "\n",
        "from datasets import load_dataset\n",
        "\n",
        "HF_DATASET_ID = \"bvsam/cic-ids-2017\"\n",
        "HF_CONFIG = \"machine_learning\"\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Loading CIC-IDS2017 from Hugging Face...\")\n",
        "print(\"This downloads/caches the dataset in the Colab runtime; no manual CSV upload is needed.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "hf_dataset = load_dataset(\n",
        "    HF_DATASET_ID,\n",
        "    name=HF_CONFIG,\n",
        "    split=\"train\",\n",
        "    streaming=False\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Dataset loaded successfully.\")\n",
        "print(\"Number of rows:\", len(hf_dataset))\n",
        "print(\"Columns:\", hf_dataset.column_names)"
      ]
    },
